<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>OneCart | About Us</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/guest-layout.css}">

    <style>
        :root {
            --green: #087e78;
            --deep-green: #123e3a;
            --mint: #e5f4f0;
            --text: #183b38;
            --muted: #687d79;
            --border: #e1ece9;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text);
            background: #fff;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .about-main {
            max-width: 1160px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 44px 24px 0;
        }

        .about-hero {
            padding: 64px 48px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: var(--mint);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: #fff;
            color: var(--green);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px);
        }

        .about-hero p {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            color: #526c67;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .about-section {
            padding: 58px 0 0;
        }

        .about-section h2 {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        .about-section p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .about-columns {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .about-card {
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .about-card .about-icon {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-size: 34px;
        }

        .about-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-size: 21px;
        }

        .about-card p {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .about-values {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .value-card {
            padding: 26px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: #f5faf8;
        }

        .value-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            color: var(--green);
        }

        .value-card p {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .about-cta {
            margin: 58px 0;
            padding: 36px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: var(--deep-green);
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-cta h2 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .about-cta p {
            margin: 0 0 24px;
            color: #d4e6e2;
        }

        .about-cta a {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #fff;
            color: var(--deep-green);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 760px) {
            .about-hero {
                padding: 40px 24px;
            }

            .about-columns,
            .about-values {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div th:replace="~{public/fragments/guest-layout :: guestHeader}"></div>

    <main class="about-main">
        <section class="about-hero">
            <span class="about-tag">ABOUT ONECART</span>
            <h1>Many vendors. One easy place to shop.</h1>
            <p>
                OneCart is a multi-vendor marketplace designed to bring
                shoppers and independent sellers together. Our goal is to
                make discovering products simple and convenient.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
            <div class="about-columns">
                <article class="about-card">
                    <div class="about-icon">🛍️</div>
                    <h3>What is OneCart?</h3>
                    <p>
                        OneCart brings products from different vendors into
                        one online marketplace. Shoppers can explore a range
                        of products without visiting separate stores.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="about-card">
                    <div class="about-icon">🤝</div>
                    <h3>Our purpose</h3>
                    <p>
                        We aim to give customers a convenient shopping
                        experience while helping vendors present their
                        products to a wider audience.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
            <h2>What matters to us</h2>

            <div class="about-values">
                <article class="value-card">
                    <h3>Convenience</h3>
                    <p>Make it easier to discover products from different sellers in one place.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="value-card">
                    <h3>Choice</h3>
                    <p>Bring different vendors and product selections together for shoppers.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="value-card">
                    <h3>Opportunity</h3>
                    <p>Help vendors introduce their products to people looking for something new.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-cta">
            <h2>Ready to explore OneCart?</h2>
            <p>Discover products or create an account to join our marketplace.</p>
            <a th:href="@{/signup}">Join OneCart</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <div th:replace="~{public/fragments/guest-layout :: guestFooter}"></div>
</body>
</html>